 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>Less Fur,Less Mess: This deshedding dog brush effectively removes loose fur, helps detangle light knots, and keeps your pet’s coat cleaner and smoother while reducing unwanted hair around your home</li>\n  <li>One-Click Self Cleaning: Make pet grooming faster and cleaner with our Self Cleaning Shedding Brush. Simply press the one-click release button to instantly remove trapped fur from the bristles, reducing cleanup time and making daily grooming more convenient</li>\n  <li>Gentle Care For Sensitive Skin: Designed as a Skin Friendly Grooming Tool, the rounded protective tips glide smoothly through your pet’s coat while helping prevent scratching or discomfort, creating a relaxing grooming experience for dogs and cats</li>\n  <li>Comfortable Grip For Effortless Grooming: Built with durable stainless steel pins and an ergonomic anti-slip handle, this Slicker Brush provides better control and a comfortable hold, reducing hand fatigue during longer grooming sessions<br><br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/5e94f8a5-1aab-4cad-93ed-b9dec11645be.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/a77d7dd4-56e1-43cb-a07e-6ef5c1a02e39.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/2a96a6df-edd3-4eb0-bfc7-220b94b3b4bd.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
